    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164630/extras/7bfa0be9ed85ebd3666f0a76759500f4.avif?t=1725179197\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164630/extras/6d68bdb362d1dec74469ce602f557219.avif?t=1725179197\" /></div><br><br><br>All the characters are above eighteen years old.<br><br>\u25c6[Story] Living with Kaede<br><br>You are living by yourself.<br>Your sister calls and and ask you<br>to watch Kaede while she is abroad.<br><br>She doesn't take no from you...<br>You used to watch her when she was a baby.<br>But it has been a while since then...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2164630/extras/8a0853adbb060293810275aed22c29ca.avif?t=1725179197\" /></div><br><br>\u25c6[Events] <br>Many things can happen when you live with Kaede.<br><br>\u25c6Your relationship with Kaede depends on your action.<br><br>- Likability<br>- Trustworthiness<br><br><br>[Game Play]<br>You can freely choose your action in each phase:<br>Morning, Noon, Evening, Late Night.<br><br>- Work and purchase items<br>- Teach her study<br>- Play video games and watch TV shows with her<br>and so on...<br><br>\u25c6[Work]<br>You can take programming gigs to earn some money.<br>You will gain more money as your skill improves.<br><br>\u25c6[Cooking]<br>You can cook by yourself to earn her trust,<br>or you can cook with her to get closer to her.<br><br>\u25c6[TV in The Living Room]<br>You can watch TV shows and play video games with her.<br>Investigate the TV in the living room to get close with her.",
